# CalcMark Relative Date Features

Tests for relative weekday, month, period, quarter, ago, and fiscal expressions.

## Weekday Expressions

wd1 = Friday
wd2 = this Friday
wd3 = next Friday
wd4 = last Friday
wd5 = next Monday
wd6 = this Wednesday
wd7 = last Sunday

## Period Expressions (Week / Month / Year)

p1 = this week
p2 = next week
p3 = last week
p4 = this month
p5 = next month
p6 = last month
p7 = this year
p8 = next year
p9 = last year

## Relative Month Expressions

m1 = this April
m2 = next April
m3 = last April
m4 = next Jan
m5 = last Dec
m6 = this September

## Calendar Quarter Expressions

q1 = this quarter
q2 = next quarter
q3 = last quarter

## AGO Expressions

a1 = 2 weeks ago
a2 = 3 months ago
a3 = 1 year ago
a4 = 7 days ago

## Extended FROM Targets

f1 = 3 days from next Friday
f2 = 2 weeks from next month
f3 = 1 month from this year

## Composition with Duration Arithmetic

c1 = next Friday + 2 weeks
c2 = this quarter + 30 days
c3 = next month - 1 week
c4 = last year + 6 months
